                                                "sense_id": "a2e902cb-2bc9-3177-acee-e0a4fea61486",
                                                "text": "I have always wondered why shoe salesmen think I can't tie my shoes by myself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b843efba-d25b-4214-afdb-9f039f7fce9d",
                                                "sense_id": "a2e902cb-2bc9-3177-acee-e0a4fea61486",
